      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: The easy fix (as far as I'm aware) is to let users specify a value for nearclip adjustment. The current implementation always tries for 1mm, allowing users to up it to 1cm or even 10cm would be massively helpful. Sticking the adjustment on the action menu would also help, since it would let users make that change *after* the quick menu becomes unusable.",
