      "mergeID": "62fb005d59410c44a3b04c00",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Right now, the camera clip planes are configured by the world author. This can result in problems like:\n\n* Not seeing your own avatar (particularly with very small avatars)\n* Seeing too much of your own avatar (this is often a problem for robot-like avatars with gigantic chests)\n* Not being able to see people giving you headpats\n\nAllowing the player to configure their clip distance - or, alternately, making it adjustable at the avatar level - would help resolve these problems.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Allow the camera near clip plane to be configured by the player",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "62def0bc930a3044b6fabcb1",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
