      "mergeID": "62fb00a15dddd221fa09ba46",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I would love to see an additional option allowing you to add a minimum clip distance to the players viewport. This is to prevent you from your own avatar body or menus clipping when in a significantly small avatar, or just prevents the clipping when getting very close to another player in general.",
